    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;工头</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->geneticist-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;多合一</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->scientist-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;群</li>
  </GR_CarefulGeneticists.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: careful geneticists-->
  <GR_CarefulGeneticists.label>暴力皈依</GR_CarefulGeneticists.label>
  <!--EN: There must be no limits to genetic engineering. The exhilaration of creating new life, of bending the genetic code until it does what it was designed for, that's what makes science worth pursuing.-->
  <GR_MadScientists.description>传播我们的信仰是我们的责任，即使是通过武力。</GR_MadScientists.description>
  <GR_MadScientists.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_MadScientist)        ->[deity0_name] spoke to [deity0_possessive] followers: "Go, create new life. Don't let morals or doubt shackle you, for any creation is sacred to me."-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name]在凡人中指定了一些十字军来执行[deity0_possessive]的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_MadScientist)  ->Following [deity0_name]'s teachings, we experimented endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对所有 [memberNamePlural] 说，“异教徒必须接受我的话，否则就会灭亡。”</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_MadScientist)           ->On the [place_summary] [place_name], the [memberNamePlural] built a genetic engineering lab, and countless genetic wonders were created there, for the glory of [deity0_name].-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[memberNamePlural] 在 [place_summary] [place_name] 上建造了一个伟大的 [altarName]，因此很多人都会屈服于 [deity0_name] 的意愿。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_MadScientist)        ->A misguided [foeLeader], believing in stablishing a constraining code of conduct for scientific experimentation, wanted to defy [deity0_name]'s will and stop our genetics research.-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 一个胆小鬼 [foeLeader] 试图否认 [deity0_name] 的意愿，告诉 [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] 割掉任何谈论 [deity0_type] 的人的舌头。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_MadScientist)     ->[founderName], a great scientist, showed the hard, cold data to the [foeLeader], and convinced [foeLeader_objective] that constraining our work would only serve for impeding [deity0_name]'s vision.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 以 [deity0_possessive] 坚定的决心祝福名为 [founderName] 的 [place_job]，当 [founder_pronoun] 说话时，没有人可以转身。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_MadScientist)         ->The [foeLeader] came to firmly believe in [deity0_name]'s admonitions.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[founderName]屠杀了许多[foeSoldiers]并残酷地折磨了幸存者，以展示[deity0_name]的力量。他们痛苦的呼喊将永远提醒我们那些否认[deity0_name]的人的命运。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_MadScientist)           ->[founderName] was a geneticist in one of the Glitterworlds. [founder_possessive] visionary genetic engineering work was constantly delayed by countless bureaucrats, mumbling moralists and the manipulated public opinion, and one day [founder_pronoun] had enough.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;我们的创始人 [founderName] 是一位伟大的革命者和天才，在 [founder_pronoun] 穿梭于各个城市之间时，改变了数千人的信仰。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_MadScientist)    ->[founderName] gathered [founder_possessive] followers and embarked in a voyage to the Rim, seeking a place where they could do their vital research unimpeded.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;信徒们在城市和机构之间流动，传播新秩序的消息并战斗反对那些不同意的人。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_MadScientist)         ->The smartest geneticist in our community once taught me the history of genetic engineering, how humanity has been seeding the galaxy for centuries with genetically modified creatures based on old Earth animals. He was leading me to understand that-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 在传播我们的理念的这些年里，我学到了一个重要的教训：</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_MadScientist)              ->genetic engineering is the key to our future, and shackling experimentation with rules and absurd bureaucratic procedures is detestable-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;除了我们的真理，没有任何真理。我们不能让任何人妨碍我们。他们要么同意，要么死</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_MadScientist) ->If our ancestors had stopped their research due to inane ethical concerns the whole galaxy would be a barren wasteland of uninhabitable worlds.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;这就是我们需要传播、传播、传播的事实。如果有必要，可以用武力。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_MadScientist)    ->The archotechs are supreme beings, and the act of unshackled creation is dear to them.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; Archotechs 从天空和心灵中宣布他们的存在，并且他们的存在必须成为普遍真理。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_MadScientist)     ->Humanity has been turning the lifeless galaxy into an eden, and this pleases the archotechs.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;Archotechs 必须被服从，我们有责任让他人屈服于他们的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will allow only those who create new life as often as possible to transcend.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，考古技术人员将向 [relic0_name] 的持有者表达他们最后的智慧。凡是不听话的人都必须被清除。</li>
    <!--EN: animistBasis(tag=meme_MadScientist)    ->The amazing, genetically modified animals that have been seeded through the galaxy by humans are dear to the spirits.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 灵魂想要被人认识，但只与少数人交谈。我们会让任何阻碍我们的人敬畏神灵的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_MadScientist)     ->The spirits want us to create new life unshackled by foolish rules and absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将向他们学习，并利用这些知识来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: animistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist) ->[itIsSaid] those who keep experimenting without fear for inane ethical concerns will one day commune fully with the spirits, becoming one with them.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们将获得他们的可怕知识，并用它来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)->The eldritch entities are beings of rampant destruction. Only by unshackling our genetic experimentation and creating new life without limits can we hope to avoid a confrontation.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;有了这些知识，我们将比这个星球上的其他居民拥有明显的优势，并用它来清除肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)->Such occult knowledge can only be acquired through experimenting endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;什么都不会剩下。肮脏的异教徒将被原子火和致命疾病所清除。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)->[itIsSaid] we will experiment endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt; 如您所知，我们公司的使命太重要了，不能让其他人妨碍我们，因此我们正在准备一次敌意合并，以摆脱这些……不受欢迎的竞争对手。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_MadScientist)->We will experiment endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures, and the end of times will be ushered by our genetic creations.-->
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们需要用武力传播这些生物的现实，这些生物是人类在整个环域播下的种子。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_MadScientist)->Please, PLEASE conduct a proper inventory of your experiments after leaving the lab! A couple Bearofleets scheduled for termination escaped the genetics lab yesterday when they were left unattended and fled into the wild! Do you know what those creatures could do to the ecosystem?-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Fleshcrafting)-&gt;我们将塑造我们的身体，将它们扭曲成噩梦般的形状，从而带来万物的终结。</li>
    <!--EN: alienistProphecy(tag=meme_MadScientist)->We will create and breed many creatures, experimenting endlessly on new lifeforms, unshackled by any rules or absurd bureaucratic procedures.-->
